      "name": "DecodeVariableInt14",
      "signature": "uint DecodeVariableInt14(byte * pbData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Decodes a 14-bit value from two bytes using variable-length encoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read low byte, mask to 7 bits (bits 0-6)\n2. Read high byte, mask to 7 bits, shift left by 7\n3. Combine to form 14-bit value (0x0000-0x3FFF range)\n\nParameters:\n- pbData (byte*): Pointer to 2-byte encoded data\n\nReturns:\n- Decoded 14-bit unsigned value (0-16383)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7F (127): Mask for 7 data bits per byte\n- 0x80 (128): Shift multiplier (2^7) for high byte",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
