      "name": "TestBitInArray",
      "signature": "uint TestBitInArray(byte * pbBitArray, uint dwBitIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Tests if a specific bit is set in a byte array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate byte offset: dwBitIndex >> 3 (divide by 8)\n2. Calculate bit position within byte: dwBitIndex & 7 (mod 8)\n3. Retrieve byte from pbBitArray at calculated offset\n4. AND with bitmask from gdwBitMasks lookup table\n\nParameters:\n- pbBitArray (byte*): Pointer to byte array containing bit flags\n- dwBitIndex (uint): Zero-based index of bit to test\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if bit is set, 0 if bit is clear",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:b40858615d740d99e599910314901de6",
