      "name": "ReadBitsFromBufferSigned",
      "signature": "int ReadBitsFromBufferSigned(uint * pBitBuffer, int nBitCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Reads a signed integer of nBitCount bits from a bit buffer, performing sign extension.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate buffer has enough bits remaining\n2. Read bits byte-by-byte using upper bit masks\n3. Shift and accumulate into result value\n4. Advance buffer position (byte pointer and bit offset)\n5. If sign bit set, extend sign to 32 bits\n\nParameters:\n- pBitBuffer (uint*): Bit buffer structure [pData, nMaxBits, nCurByte, nBitOffset]\n- nBitCount (int): Number of bits to read (1-32)\n\nReturns:\n- Signed integer with sign extension if high bit set\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ReadBitsFromBuffer (Ordinal 10130): Unsigned variant",
