      "name": "CommitBufferWrite",
      "signature": "void CommitBufferWrite(int * pBufCtx)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Commits a pending write to a buffer context structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dirty flag (offset 0xc) is set\n2. If dirty: increment buffer pointer and element count\n3. Clear dirty flag\n4. If (count * 8) < limit, null-terminate at new position\n\nParameters:\n- pBufCtx (int*): Pointer to 16-byte buffer context structure:\n  - [0x0]: Current buffer pointer\n  - [0x4]: Buffer size limit\n  - [0x8]: Element count\n  - [0xc]: Dirty/modified flag\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8: Element stride (8 bytes per entry)",
