      "name": "TitleCaseString",
      "signature": "void TitleCaseString(char * szString)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Converts string to Title Case (first letter of each word uppercase, rest lowercase).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Null check and compute string length via SCASB\n2. Iterate through each character up to length (max 1024)\n3. On space: set \"start of word\" flag\n4. On non-space at word start: call toupper (FUN_6ff721b7)\n5. On non-space mid-word: call tolower (FUN_6ff7207d)\n6. Store converted character back to string\n\nParameters:\n- szString (char*): Input string modified in-place\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x400 (1024): Maximum string length enforced\n- 0x78 (120): Source file line number for assertion\n- 0x20 (32): ASCII space character",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
