      "name": "QSAddPort",
      "signature": "SOCKET QSAddPort(int * pqsContext, u_short wPort)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Adds a listening port to the Query Server (QS) context for NT-based systems.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pqsContext->fUseNT flag is non-zero\n2. On failure, assert with error message and terminate\n3. Delegate to internal QSNTInit to create socket/bind/listen\n\nParameters:\n- pqsContext (int*): QS context structure, must have fUseNT flag at offset 0\n- wPort (u_short): Port number to bind and listen on\n\nReturns:\n- Valid SOCKET handle on success\n- INVALID_SOCKET (0) on failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff66b30: Internal NT socket initialization (QSNTInit)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
