      "name": "WaitForArchiveEvent",
      "signature": "DWORD WaitForArchiveEvent(int * pArchive, DWORD dwTimeout)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Waits for an archive event handle if the archive is not closing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if archive close flag (*pArchive) is non-zero\n2. If closing, return 0 immediately (cannot wait)\n3. Otherwise call WaitForSingleObject on event handle at offset 0xBD4\n4. Return wait result (WAIT_OBJECT_0, WAIT_TIMEOUT, etc.)\n\nParameters:\n- pArchive (int*): Pointer to archive structure with close flag at offset 0\n- dwTimeout (DWORD): Milliseconds to wait, or INFINITE (-1)\n\nReturns:\n- 0 if archive is closing (close flag != 0)\n- WAIT_OBJECT_0 (0) if event signaled\n- WAIT_TIMEOUT (0x102) if timeout elapsed\n- WAIT_FAILED (0xFFFFFFFF) on error\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xBD4 (3028): Offset to event HANDLE in archive structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:19a56ea0d200b10397577a1850ce4ec5",
