      "name": "RefreshCacheEntryTimer",
      "signature": "bool RefreshCacheEntryTimer(void * this, uint dwEntryId)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Looks up cache entry by ID and resets its timer to 120 ticks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section at this+0x894\n2. Hash dwEntryId % bucketCount to find bucket\n3. Walk linked list at bucket for matching ID\n4. If found and entry active (offset 8 != 0), set timer to 0x78 (120)\n5. Leave critical section\n\nParameters:\n- this (void*): Cache manager object\n- dwEntryId (uint): Entry ID to look up\n\nReturns:\n- true (1) if entry found and timer refreshed\n- false (0) if entry not found or inactive\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x894: Critical section offset in cache manager\n- 0x8ac: Hash table pointer offset\n- 0x8b0: Bucket count offset\n- 0x78 (120): Timer reset value in ticks",
