      "name": "GetSocketPeerAddress",
      "signature": "uint GetSocketPeerAddress(FogHashTable * pHashTable, uint dwSocketId)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves the IPv4 address of the remote peer for a socket.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute bucket index: dwSocketId & pHashTable->dwMask\n2. Calculate critical section offset: bucket * 0x18\n3. Enter critical section for the bucket via Ordinal_10050\n4. Get bucket head from pHashTable->ppBuckets[bucket]\n5. Search linked list for entry matching dwSocketId\n6. If not found, leave critical section and return 0\n7. Get SOCKET handle from node at offset 0x10\n8. Leave critical section\n9. Call getpeername to get peer sockaddr\n10. Extract IPv4 address from sa_data[2..5]\n\nParameters:\n- pHashTable (FogHashTable*): Socket hash table structure\n- dwSocketId (uint): Socket ID to look up\n\nReturns:\n- IPv4 address as uint (network byte order) on success\n- 0 if socket not found in table\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18 (24): Critical section entry stride\n- 0x10 (16): Offset to SOCKET in node structure\n- 0x10 (16): Size of sockaddr structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
