      "name": "LookupHashValue",
      "signature": "uint LookupHashValue(FogHashTable * pHashTable, uint dwKey)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Looks up a value in a hash table by key.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute bucket index: dwKey AND dwMask\n2. Enter critical section for the bucket (stride 0x18)\n3. Traverse linked list in bucket searching for matching key\n4. If found, return value at entry offset 0x10\n5. If not found, return 0\n6. Leave critical section before returning\n\nParameters:\n- pHashTable (FogHashTable*): Hash table structure\n- dwKey (uint): Key to search for\n\nReturns:\n- Value associated with key if found, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18 (24): Critical section stride per bucket\n- 0x10 (16): Offset to value in hash entry (puVar1[4])",
