      "name": "ReleaseClientFromHashTable",
      "signature": "int ReleaseClientFromHashTable(FogHashTable * pHashTable, uint * pdwClientKey)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Releases a client entry from a hash table by decrementing reference count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute bucket index: dwBucket = *pdwClientKey % pHashTable->dwBucketCount\n2. Get first node in bucket from pHashTable->ppBuckets[dwBucket]\n3. Traverse linked list searching for matching key\n4. If key not found, return 0 (failure)\n5. Decrement reference count at node offset +4\n6. If count reaches 0 or below, unlink node from list\n7. Call Ordinal_10043 (FreeHashNode) to deallocate the node\n8. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pHashTable (FogHashTable*): Hash table structure with bucket count at +0x10, bucket array at +0x40\n- pdwClientKey (uint*): Pointer to client key value to search for and release\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Entry found and reference released (may or may not have been freed)\n- 0: Entry not found in hash table\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10: Offset to bucket count (dwBucketCount) in FogHashTable\n- 0x40: Offset to bucket array pointer (ppBuckets) in FogHashTable\n- 0x8e7 (2279): Source line number passed to Ordinal_10043 for debugging",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:cfb8e1932a75d40e68c215ca00213e7a",
