      "name": "GetEntityCount",
      "signature": "int GetEntityCount(void * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Counts total entities in a hash table structure.\n\nIterates through all hash buckets and follows linked lists\nto count the total number of entities stored in the table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Returns 0 if context pointer is NULL\n2. Acquires critical section lock at offset 0x854\n3. Gets bucket count from offset 0x87c\n4. Gets bucket array pointer from offset 0x870\n5. Iterates each bucket, following linked list via offset 0x5bc\n6. Increments counter for each entity node\n7. Releases critical section and returns total count\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): Pointer to context structure with hash table\n\nReturns:\n- Total entity count, or 0 if pContext is NULL\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x854: Critical section offset in context\n- 0x870: Hash bucket array pointer offset\n- 0x87c: Bucket count offset\n- 0x5bc: Next entity pointer offset in linked list",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
