      "name": "AddUniqueKeyValuePair",
      "signature": "void AddUniqueKeyValuePair(void * pContainer, dword dwValue, int nKey)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Adds a key-value pair to a container's associative array if the key is not already present.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current entry count from container offset 0x848\n2. Return early if count >= 256 (0x100) - array is full\n3. Iterate through existing entries at offset 0x48, stride 8 bytes\n4. If key already exists, return without modification (no duplicates)\n5. Store new key at [0x48 + count*8], value at [0x4c + count*8]\n6. Increment entry count\n\nParameters:\n- pContainer (void*): Structure containing key-value array at +0x48 and count at +0x848\n- dwValue (dword): Value to associate with the key\n- nKey (int): Key to add (checked for uniqueness)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x48: Offset to key-value array in container\n- 0x4c: Offset to value within each 8-byte entry\n- 0x848: Offset to entry count\n- 0x100 (256): Maximum array capacity\n- 8: Stride between entries (4-byte key + 4-byte value)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8036de8b290eaa5761b6de0f3c300b9c",
