      "name": "ProcessAsyncIOChannels",
      "signature": "uint ProcessAsyncIOChannels(void * pContext, uint dwTimeout)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Processes async I/O completion on all 4 channels for an I/O context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If pContext+0xC18 is non-zero (shutdown flag), return 1 immediately\n2. Iterate over 4 I/O channels at pContext+0xB90\n3. For each channel with valid handle (!= -1), call ProcessCompletionPortEvents\n4. Always returns 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (void*): I/O context, +0xB90=channel handles[4], +0xC18=shutdown flag\n- dwTimeout (uint): Timeout in milliseconds passed to completion port wait\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xB90: Offset to channel handle array (4 DWORDs)\n- 0xC18: Shutdown/processing flag offset\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF): Invalid channel handle sentinel",
