      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Frees memory from a tracked pool, respecting memory tracking flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy dwAddress to stack for pass-by-reference\n2. If g_dwMemTrackFlags is non-zero, use dwPool; else use 0 (default pool)\n3. Call internal free routine with pool mask and address pointer\n4. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- dwPool (uint): Pool handle to free from (masked by tracking flags)\n- dwAddress (uint): Memory address to free\n\nReturns:\n- 1 always (success)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- AllocPoolMemoryTracked: Allocation counterpart\n- SetMemoryTrackingFlags: Controls g_dwMemTrackFlags",
