      "name": "GetGlobalMemoryStatus",
      "signature": "void GetGlobalMemoryStatus(LPMEMORYSTATUS lpMemStatus)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes and fills a MEMORYSTATUS structure with system memory info.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Zero the MEMORYSTATUS structure using REP STOSD (8 DWORDs = 32 bytes)\n2. Set dwLength field to 0x20 (32 bytes, required structure size)\n3. Call GlobalMemoryStatus to populate remaining fields\n\nParameters:\n- lpMemStatus (LPMEMORYSTATUS): Pointer to structure to receive memory info\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nNotes:\n- iVar1/p_Var2 are decompiler-generated temps representing ECX/EDI registers",
