      "name": "GetIndexStringCode",
      "signature": "int GetIndexStringCode(int * pIndex, int nIndexValue, char * szCodeOut)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves a 4-character string code by index value from an index table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pIndex is not NULL\n2. Validate nIndexValue is within bounds [0, count)\n3. Linear search through 8-byte entries for matching index value\n4. Copy 4-char code to szCodeOut, converting spaces to null terminators\n5. Null-terminate output string\n\nParameters:\n- pIndex (int*): Index table structure [count, ?, data_ptr]\n- nIndexValue (int): Index value to search for\n- szCodeOut (char*): Output buffer for 5-byte code string (4 chars + null)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Success, code found and copied\n- 0: Index value not found in table\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset | Size | Field |\n|--------|------|-------|\n| 0x00 | 4 | count |\n| 0x08 | 4 | data_ptr |\n\nEntry Layout (8 bytes each):\n| Offset | Size | Field |\n|--------|------|-------|\n| 0x00 | 4 | 4-char code |\n| 0x04 | 4 | index value |",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:7a3e92bb1ccd15cb5f6e968d7cc628cc",
