      "name": "PollAsyncOperationStatus",
      "signature": "uint PollAsyncOperationStatus(int * pAsyncData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Polls async operation completion status without blocking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pAsyncData pointer is not NULL\n2. Verify ASYNC_DATA magic signature (0x41737960) in flags field\n3. If completion bit (bit 0) is clear, check event with zero timeout\n4. If event is signaled (wait returns 0), call CompleteAsyncOperation\n5. Return current completion status (bit 0 of dwFlags)\n\nParameters:\n- pAsyncData (int*): Pointer to ASYNC_DATA structure at offset 0x38 contains\n  event handle pointer, offset 0x48 contains flags with magic signature\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if operation is complete, 0 if still pending\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x41737960: ASYNC_DATA magic signature (\"Asy`\" masked)\n- 0x48: Offset to dwFlags field in ASYNC_DATA structure\n- 0x38: Offset to event handle pointer in ASYNC_DATA structure",
