      "comment": "Waits for an async operation to complete and finalizes it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pAsyncData is non-null\n2. Verify magic signature (0x41737960 with mask 0xFFFFFFF0)\n3. If not already complete, poll event handle with 0 timeout\n4. If signaled, call CompleteAsyncOperation immediately\n5. If still pending, signal worker thread and wait infinitely\n6. Assert wait succeeded, then finalize with CompleteAsyncOperation\n\nParameters:\n- pAsyncData (int*): Async operation context structure\n\nReturns:\n- void (asserts on failure, never returns on error)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x41737960: ASYNC_DATA signature (\"Asy`\")\n- 0x48: dwFlags field offset\n- 0x38: pEventHandle pointer offset\n- 0x3C: Worker thread handle offset\n- 0x1: ASYNC_FLAG_COMPLETE bit",
