      "name": "ShutdownFog",
      "signature": "void ShutdownFog(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Atexit handler that shuts down all Fog library subsystems.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if Fog was initialized (g_fFogInitStarted)\n2. Shutdown async data system\n3. Destroy global memory pool\n4. Clear g_dwFogParam2\n5. Cleanup symbol helper\n6. Shutdown log files and interlock system\n7. Shutdown log manager\n8. Clear g_fFogInitStarted flag\n9. Delete main and secondary critical sections\n\nParameters:\n- None (registered via atexit in FogInit)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FogInit: Registers this as atexit handler",
