      "name": "WriteLogHeader",
      "signature": "void WriteLogHeader(dword dwContext, void * pfnWriter)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Writes diagnostic header to log output.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current local time via GetLocalTime\n2. Get user name via GetUserNameA (64-char buffer)\n3. Get computer name via GetComputerNameA (64-char buffer)\n4. Build program name string (base name + optional suffix from DAT_6ffa05e0)\n5. Format and write header lines via callback:\n   - Separator line\n   - Program name\n   - Computer name\n   - User name  \n   - Timestamp (MM/DD/YY HH:MM:SS.mmm)\n   - Separator line\n\nParameters:\n- dwContext (dword): Context value passed to callback in ECX\n- pfnWriter (void*): Callback function pointer for writing lines\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40 (64): Max length for user/computer name buffers\n- 0x104 (260): MAX_PATH buffer size for program name\n- 0x200 (512): Output line buffer size",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:97123af7ad61d15849ffb855bd5ba8e0",
