      "name": "FindModuleByAddress",
      "signature": "ModuleInfoNode * FindModuleByAddress(uint dwAddress, ModuleInfoNode * pModuleList)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Searches a linked list of ModuleInfoNode entries to find one containing the given address.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through linked list starting at pModuleList\n2. For each module, check if dwAddress is within [dwBaseAddress, dwBaseAddress + dwModuleSize)\n3. Return module pointer if address is in range, else continue to next\n4. Return NULL if no module contains the address\n\nParameters:\n- dwAddress (uint): Memory address to locate\n- pModuleList (ModuleInfoNode*): Pointer to head of module linked list\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to ModuleInfoNode containing dwAddress, or NULL if not found\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff6f150: Creates module info list from process snapshot\n- FUN_6ff6f380: Alternative module info list creation",
