      "name": "ReadFileAsync",
      "signature": "void ReadFileAsync(dword dwFileHandle, void * pBuffer, dword dwBytesToRead, dword * pdwBytesRead, void * pOverlapped, void * pCallback, dword dwUserData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Passes through to Storm's SFileReadFile with swapped callback/userData params.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reorders parameters: swaps pCallback and dwUserData positions\n2. Calls SFileReadFile (Ordinal_289) with reordered args\n3. Returns immediately (callee cleanup via RET 0x14)\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileHandle (dword): File handle from SFileOpenFile\n- pBuffer (void*): Destination buffer for read data\n- dwBytesToRead (dword): Number of bytes to read\n- pdwBytesRead (dword*): Output for actual bytes read\n- pOverlapped (void*): OVERLAPPED struct for async I/O\n- pCallback (void*): Async completion callback\n- dwUserData (dword): User context for callback\n\nReturns:\n- void (result returned via pdwBytesRead)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_289: SFileReadFile (Storm.dll import)\n- InitAsyncFileOperation: Primary caller for async reads",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
