      "comment": "Wrapper for kernel32.GetFileSize via Ordinal_265 jump table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pushes EDX (pdwFileSizeHigh) and ECX (hFile) to stack\n2. Calls Ordinal_265 which dispatches to imported GetFileSize\n3. Returns result in EAX (low 32-bit file size)\n\nParameters:\n- hFile (uint): File handle from CreateFile/OpenFile\n- pdwFileSizeHigh (uint*): Optional ptr for high 32-bits; NULL if not needed\n\nReturns:\n- Low 32-bit file size on success\n- INVALID_FILE_SIZE (0xFFFFFFFF) on failure; check GetLastError()",
