      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Wrapper for Win32 CreateFileA API.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pass all parameters directly to CreateFileA\n2. Return the file HANDLE from CreateFileA\n\nParameters:\n- lpszFileName (char*): Path to the file to open/create\n- dwDesiredAccess (DWORD): Access mode (GENERIC_READ, GENERIC_WRITE)\n- dwShareMode (DWORD): File sharing mode\n- lpSecurityAttributes (LPSECURITY_ATTRIBUTES): Security descriptor\n- dwCreationDisposition (DWORD): Action if file exists/doesn't exist\n- dwFlagsAndAttributes (DWORD): File attributes and flags\n- hTemplateFile (HANDLE): Template file for attributes\n\nReturns:\n- HANDLE to opened file on success\n- INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE (0xFFFFFFFF) on failure",
