      "name": "SetFilePointerWrapper",
      "signature": "dword SetFilePointerWrapper(HANDLE hFile, long lDistanceToMove, PLONG lpDistanceToMoveHigh, DWORD dwMoveMethod)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Thin wrapper around SetFilePointer Win32 API.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Forward all parameters directly to SetFilePointer\n2. Return result from SetFilePointer\n\nParameters:\n- hFile (HANDLE): File handle to reposition\n- lDistanceToMove (LONG): Low-order 32-bits of move distance\n- lpDistanceToMoveHigh (PLONG): Pointer to high-order 32-bits of move distance\n- dwMoveMethod (DWORD): Starting point (FILE_BEGIN=0, FILE_CURRENT=1, FILE_END=2)\n\nReturns:\n- Low-order DWORD of new file pointer, or INVALID_SET_FILE_POINTER (0xFFFFFFFF) on error",
