      "comment": "Appends a trailing backslash to a path string if not already present.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pszPath and dwBufSize are non-null/non-zero\n2. Get current string length via strlen\n3. Check if last char is already '\\\\'\n4. If not '\\\\' and buffer has room (len+2 <= size), append '\\\\' and null terminator\n\nParameters:\n- pszPath (char*): Path string buffer to modify\n- dwBufSize (uint): Total buffer size including null terminator\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies buffer in-place)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5c (92): ASCII backslash '\\\\'",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:044bb31668c1c443ff2e85256cc3de38",
