      "name": "GetInstallPath",
      "signature": "void GetInstallPath(char * szPathOut, uint dwMaxLen)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves the Diablo II install path into the provided buffer.\nTries registry first, then falls back to module directory.\nEnsures the returned path ends with a backslash separator.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read InstallPath from registry via Ordinal_422\n2. If registry lookup fails, clear path buffer\n3. Verify path exists via GetFileAttributesA\n4. If path invalid, get module directory path\n5. Find and truncate at last backslash\n6. Save working path to registry via Ordinal_425\n7. Append trailing backslash if missing\n\nParameters:\n- szPathOut (char*): Output buffer for install path\n- dwMaxLen (uint): Maximum buffer size in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- void (path written to szPathOut buffer)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
