      "name": "AddBufferEntry",
      "signature": "int AddBufferEntry(dword dwValue1, dword dwValue2, dword dwValue3, EntryBuffer * pBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Adds a 12-byte entry to a fixed-size buffer array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current entry count from pBuffer->nCount\n2. Calculate required size: count * 12 + 20 (header)\n3. If size > 0x400 (1024), return 0xE (buffer full)\n4. Store dwValue1, dwValue2, dwValue3 at entry offset\n5. Increment entry count, return 0 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue1 (dword): First value to store at entry+0\n- dwValue2 (dword): Second value to store at entry+4\n- dwValue3 (dword): Third value to store at entry+8\n- pBuffer (EntryBuffer*): Buffer with count at +4, entries at +8\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Success\n- 0xE (14): Buffer overflow (would exceed 1024 bytes)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xC (12): Entry stride (3 dwords)\n- 0x14 (20): Header size before entries\n- 0x400 (1024): Maximum buffer size",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:a5b781f8937576c22a01c544b27363dd",
