      "name": "GetAdjustedPosition",
      "signature": "uint GetAdjustedPosition(void * this, int nOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "comment": "Returns adjusted position from internal buffer state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current position from this+4\n2. If position is negative (error state), return bitwise NOT (~pos)\n3. If nOffset < 0, calculate offset from vtable base pointer\n4. Return position + offset\n\nParameters:\n- this (void*): Buffer/stream object with position at offset 0x4\n- nOffset (int): Offset to add; if < 0, derives from vtable\n\nReturns:\n- Adjusted position value, or error code if internal state is negative",
