      "comment": "Thunk wrapper for WinSock closesocket API.\n\nCloses an existing socket and releases associated resources.\nThis is an ordinal export (10000) providing socket cleanup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push socket handle parameter onto stack\n2. Call closesocket via import table at 0x6ff7e250\n3. Return (discarding closesocket return value)\n\nParameters:\n- sSocket (SOCKET): Socket handle to close\n\nReturns:\n- void (return value from closesocket is discarded)",
