      "name": "CreateStormThread",
      "signature": "void * CreateStormThread(char * szServerAddr, dword dwPort, LPTHREAD_START_ROUTINE pfnThreadProc, LPVOID pThreadParam, char * szThreadName)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Creates a Storm thread with TCP connection (blocking mode).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Forward all parameters to CreateTcpConnection with flags=0\n2. Return connection context pointer\n\nParameters:\n- szServerAddr (char*): Server IP address string\n- dwPort (dword): Server port number\n- pfnThreadProc (LPTHREAD_START_ROUTINE): Thread callback function\n- pThreadParam (LPVOID): Thread callback parameter\n- szThreadName (char*): Debug name for thread (max 64 chars)\n\nReturns:\n- void*: Connection context on success, NULL on failure\n\nNotes:\n- Thin wrapper for CreateTcpConnection with flags=0 (blocking mode)\n- Exported as Storm ordinal 10003",
