      "name": "SendSocketDataLocked",
      "signature": "int SendSocketDataLocked(FogSocketContext * pContext, byte * pbData, int nLength)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sends data over a socket connection with critical section locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pContext is non-NULL and not closed (fClosed == 0)\n2. Enter critical section at pContext->critSection\n3. Call send() with socket pContext->hSocket\n4. If bytes sent != requested, store WSAGetLastError in dwLastError, set dwState to 4\n5. Leave critical section and return bytes sent (or 0 on error)\n\nParameters:\n- pContext (FogSocketContext*): Socket context structure\n- pbData (byte*): Buffer containing data to send\n- nLength (int): Number of bytes to send\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes sent on success (equals nLength)\n- 0 on failure or if context is NULL/closed\n\nStructure Layout (FogSocketContext):\n- +0x08: hSocket (SOCKET handle)\n- +0x0C: critSection (CRITICAL_SECTION)\n- +0x2C: fClosed (0 = open)\n- +0x30: dwState (4 = error state)\n- +0x34: dwLastError (WSA error code)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4b96d4e4d8a6ef551c935747fac66f68",
