      "name": "GetPeerName",
      "signature": "bool GetPeerName(int nSocketContext, sockaddr * pSockAddr, int * pnAddrLen)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves the peer socket address with thread-safe locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section at offset 0xC in socket context\n2. Call getpeername on socket at offset 0x8\n3. Leave critical section\n4. Return success/failure based on getpeername result\n\nParameters:\n- nSocketContext (int): Socket context structure containing socket handle and critical section\n- pSockAddr (sockaddr*): Output buffer for peer address\n- pnAddrLen (int*): In/out parameter for address buffer size\n\nReturns:\n- true if getpeername succeeded, false on error (-1 return)\n\nStructure Layout:\n- +0x08: SOCKET handle\n- +0x0C: CRITICAL_SECTION for thread safety",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
