      "name": "InetNtoaToStaticBuffer",
      "signature": "char * InetNtoaToStaticBuffer(in_addr inAddr)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Converts IP address to string and copies to static buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call inet_ntoa() to convert in_addr to string\n2. Calculate string length via REPNE SCASB (strlen)\n3. Copy string to static buffer g_szIpAddressBuffer via REP MOVSD/MOVSB\n\nParameters:\n- inAddr (in_addr): IP address structure to convert\n\nReturns:\n- char*: Pointer to static buffer g_szIpAddressBuffer (0x6ffa1554)\n\nNotes:\n- Returns pointer to static buffer; not thread-safe\n- Buffer is 16 bytes (max IP string \"255.255.255.255\\0\")",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
