      "comment": "Retrieves X and Y position values from a structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read DWORD at pStruct+0x30 into pdwOutX\n2. Read DWORD at pStruct+0x34 into pdwOutY\n3. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pStruct (void*): Pointer to structure containing position data\n- pdwOutX (uint*): Output pointer for X coordinate at offset 0x30\n- pdwOutY (uint*): Output pointer for Y coordinate at offset 0x34\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always succeeds\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x30 (48): Offset of X position in structure\n- 0x34 (52): Offset of Y position in structure",
