      "name": "ExecuteExitHandlers",
      "signature": "void ExecuteExitHandlers(dword nExitCode, int nQuickExit, int nSkipCleanup)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Executes registered atexit handlers and terminates the process.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call LockExitHandler() for thread safety\n2. If already exiting (g_dwExitState==1), terminate process immediately\n3. Set g_dwExitInProgress=1 and store nSkipCleanup flag\n4. If not quick exit: iterate atexit table in reverse, calling each handler\n5. Call ExecuteFunctionPointerTable() for section terminators\n6. If nSkipCleanup==0, set exit state and call ExitProcess\n7. Otherwise call UnlockExitHandler() and return\n\nParameters:\n- nExitCode (dword): Process exit code passed to ExitProcess/TerminateProcess\n- nQuickExit (int): If non-zero, skip atexit handler execution\n- nSkipCleanup (int): If zero, calls ExitProcess; otherwise returns after cleanup\n\nReturns:\n- void (does not return if nSkipCleanup==0 due to ExitProcess)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:eb17d7abe573793d4b67d9aac794697b",
