      "name": "AllocaStackProbe",
      "signature": "void AllocaStackProbe(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "MSVC stack probe routine (_alloca_probe/__chkstk).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Takes requested allocation size in EAX\n2. Probes stack in 4KB increments to touch guard pages\n3. Subtracts remaining bytes from ESP\n4. Restores return address and jumps back to caller\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains allocation size in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies ESP to allocate stack space)\n\nNotes:\n- Called implicitly by compiler for large stack allocations\n- Ensures stack guard pages are properly committed\n- Uses TEST [ECX],EAX to touch each page without modifying it",
