      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the floating-point unit (FPU) environment during CRT startup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up floating-point exception trap handler pointers\n2. Check processor for floating-point feature support via IsProcessorFeaturePresent\n3. Store feature presence flag in global g_fHasFpuFeature\n4. Configure FPU control word with precision/rounding settings\n5. Clear pending FPU exceptions with FNCLEX\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nCalled By:\n- CallStaticInitializers (CRT initialization sequence)",
