      "name": "MemFree",
      "signature": "void MemFree(void * pBlock)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Frees a memory block allocated by MemAlloc/MemRealloc.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return early if pBlock is NULL\n2. If heap mode is 3 (SBH): Lookup block in small block heap via FUN_6ff75249, \n   free via FUN_6ff75274, exit early if freed successfully\n3. If heap mode is 2 (Virtual): Lookup block in virtual allocation list via \n   FUN_6ff75fa4, release page tracking via FUN_6ff75ffb, exit early if freed\n4. Fallback to HeapFree for standard heap allocations\n\nParameters:\n- pBlock (void*): Pointer to memory block to free, or NULL (safe no-op)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 3: SBH (Small Block Heap) mode - uses FUN_6ff75249/FUN_6ff75274\n- 2: Virtual allocation mode - uses FUN_6ff75fa4/FUN_6ff75ffb\n- 9: Critical section index for memory operations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
