      "name": "GetCurrentTimestamp",
      "signature": "void GetCurrentTimestamp(int * pnTimestamp)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Gets current timestamp with daylight saving time adjustment.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get local and system time via Windows API\n2. Compare system time with cached values to detect time change\n3. If time changed, call GetTimeZoneInformation to update DST status\n4. Cache current system time for next comparison\n5. Convert local time to timestamp via FUN_6ff76925\n\nParameters:\n- pnTimestamp (int*): Output buffer for timestamp, can be NULL\n\nReturns:\n- void (timestamp stored in pnTimestamp if non-NULL)\n\nGlobals:\n- g_nDaylightStatus: DST state (-1=error, 0=standard, 1=daylight)\n- g_stCachedSystemTime: Cached SYSTEMTIME for change detection",
