      "name": "CloseLogFile",
      "signature": "int CloseLogFile(FILE * pFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Closes a FILE stream with lock protection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if file has special flag 0x40 (string mode/no-close)\n2. If flag set: clear _flag field and return -1 (skip actual close)\n3. Otherwise: lock file, call __fclose_lk, unlock file\n\nParameters:\n- pFile (FILE*): File stream to close\n\nReturns:\n- -1 if file has 0x40 flag set (file not actually closed)\n- Result from __fclose_lk otherwise (0 on success)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40: FILE._flag bit indicating special mode (skip close)\n- 0x0C: Offset of _flag field in FILE structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:e9b7e334c31a0ed876fb0ca3fc54ed48",
