      "name": "ReadStreamLocked",
      "signature": "uint ReadStreamLocked(char * pbBuffer, uint dwElementSize, uint dwCount, int * pStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Thread-safe wrapper for reading elements from a stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquires stream critical section lock\n2. Calls ReadStreamBuffered to perform actual read\n3. Releases stream lock\n4. Returns count of elements read\n\nParameters:\n- pbBuffer (char*): Destination buffer for read data\n- dwElementSize (uint): Size in bytes of each element\n- dwCount (uint): Number of elements to read\n- pStream (int*): Stream structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- Number of complete elements successfully read",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
