      "name": "SetFpuDoublePrecision",
      "signature": "void SetFpuDoublePrecision(void * pUnused)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Configures the FPU to use 53-bit double precision mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push precision mask 0x30000 (bits 16-17)\n2. Push new precision value 0x10000 (53-bit/double precision)\n3. Call FPU control word modifier to apply masked bits\n4. Clean up stack and return\n\nParameters:\n- pUnused (void*): Not used, passed via ECX from calling context\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10000: Double precision (53-bit mantissa, PC=10)\n- 0x30000: Precision control mask (bits 16-17)\n\nCalled By:\n- InitializeFpuEnvironment (CRT startup FPU configuration)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
