      "name": "HasFdivBug",
      "signature": "int HasFdivBug(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Detects the Intel Pentium FDIV bug via floating-point remainder test.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load test dividend (g_dFdivTestDividend) and divisor (g_dFdivTestDivisor)\n2. Compute remainder: dividend - (dividend/divisor)*divisor\n3. Compare remainder against g_dGammaStep threshold\n4. Return true (1) if remainder exceeds threshold (bug present)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if FDIV bug detected (remainder too large)\n- 0 if FPU computes correctly\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff737f3: Caller that first tries IsProcessorFeaturePresent",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:49e318c9f11868b2ccda0cc5be0e6fb1",
