      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Formats a double value as fixed-point decimal string (printf %f format).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decompose double into sign, digit count, and mantissa digits\n2. Copy mantissa digits to buffer with rounding at specified precision\n3. Insert sign and decimal point formatting\n\nParameters:\n- pdValue (double*): Pointer to double value to format\n- szBuffer (char*): Output buffer for formatted string\n- nPrecision (size_t): Number of decimal places\n\nReturns:\n- szBuffer pointer on success",
