      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Clears FPU stack and returns 0.0 for out-of-range inputs.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pop and discard ST0 (FSTP ST0)\n2. Load 0.0 onto FPU stack (FLDZ)\n3. Return with 0.0 in ST0\n\nParameters:\n- None (implicitly expects value on ST0 to discard)\n\nReturns:\n- ST0 = 0.0 (float10)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ComputeFractionalExp2Minus1: Caller that invokes this for overflow cases",
