      "name": "GetModuleLinkerVersion",
      "signature": "void GetModuleLinkerVersion(ushort * pwVersion)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Extracts linker version from current module's PE header.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize output to 0\n2. Get module handle for current process (NULL param)\n3. Verify DOS signature (MZ = 0x5A4D)\n4. Read e_lfanew offset at DOS+0x3C to locate PE header\n5. Extract MajorLinkerVersion (PE+0x1A) and MinorLinkerVersion (PE+0x1B)\n6. Store as packed ushort (major in low byte, minor in high byte)\n\nParameters:\n- pwVersion (ushort*): Output buffer for packed linker version\n\nReturns:\n- void; version returned via pwVersion pointer (0 if invalid PE)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5A4D: DOS MZ signature\n- 0x3C: DOS header offset to e_lfanew\n- 0x1A: PE optional header offset to MajorLinkerVersion\n- 0x1B: PE optional header offset to MinorLinkerVersion",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d8be7433da8984a6d08ceacc3367b90b",
