      "name": "FreeSbhRegionNode",
      "signature": "void FreeSbhRegionNode(void * * ppNode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Frees a Small Block Heap (SBH) region node and unlinks it from the circular list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. VirtualFree the virtual memory block at ppNode[4] with MEM_RELEASE\n2. If this node is current, update g_pSbhCurrentNode to next node\n3. If NOT sentinel node: unlink from doubly-linked list, HeapFree the node\n4. If IS sentinel node: mark VM flag as -1 (deallocated)\n\nParameters:\n- ppNode (void**): Pointer to SBH region node structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000: MEM_RELEASE flag for VirtualFree\n- 0xffffffff: Sentinel value indicating deallocated state\n- 0x4: Offset to next pointer in node\n- 0x10: Offset to virtual memory pointer in node\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff75ee2: Calls this after freeing all pages in a region\n- CleanupHeapAllocations: Uses same linked list structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:54ffff5ceafbb1247d2270b70dfe4f31",
