      "name": "ReleaseVirtualPages",
      "signature": "void ReleaseVirtualPages(int nPageCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Releases virtual memory pages marked for decommit across SBH regions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through SBH region linked list starting from g_pArenaListTail\n2. For each region with valid base address (!= -1):\n   - Scan page entries backwards from offset 0x3FF000 (1023 pages)\n   - For entries marked 0xF0 (decommit pending), call VirtualFree with MEM_DECOMMIT\n   - Mark freed entries as -1, decrement global page count, update free hint\n3. After freeing, if all page entries are -1 and group header is -1:\n   - Check if entire region is empty (all 1024 entries freed)\n   - If empty, call FreeSbhRegionNode to release the region\n4. Continue to next region until nPageCount pages freed or list exhausted\n\nParameters:\n- nPageCount: Maximum number of pages to decommit\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xF0 (240): Page entry state \"decommit pending\"\n- 0x1000 (4096): Page size\n- 0x4000: MEM_DECOMMIT flag for VirtualFree\n- 0x400 (1024): Entries per region\n- 0x3FF000: Max page offset (1023 * 0x1000)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4356a93c484fa354f7841c9d1d714a19",
