      "name": "SetFpuErrno",
      "signature": "void SetFpuErrno(int nExceptType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Sets errno based on FPU exception type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If exception type is 1 (domain), set errno to EDOM (0x21)\n2. If exception type is 2 or 3 (range), set errno to ERANGE (0x22)\n3. Otherwise return without setting errno\n\nParameters:\n- nExceptType (int): Exception type from FPU handler (1=domain, 2-3=range)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x21 (33): EDOM - Math argument out of domain\n- 0x22 (34): ERANGE - Math result out of range",
