      "name": "GetAndClearFpuStatus",
      "signature": "int GetAndClearFpuStatus(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves FPU status word and clears FPU exceptions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store FPU status word to stack via FNSTSW\n2. Clear all FPU exceptions via FNCLEX\n3. Return status word sign-extended to int\n\nParameters:\n- None (reads FPU status register directly)\n\nReturns:\n- FPU status word (sign-extended to int)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- RaiseFloatingPointException (caller)",
