      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires lock for stream critical section.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pStream is within global stream array (0x6ff86370-0x6ff865d0)\n2. If in range: compute index, call LockCriticalSectionByIndex\n3. If not in range: call EnterCriticalSection on embedded CS at offset +0x20\n\nParameters:\n- pStream (void*): Stream object pointer (uses void* as streams have different embedded structs)\n\nReturns:\n- void (acquires lock, no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6ff86370: Start of global stream array\n- 0x6ff865d0: End of global stream array\n- 0x20 (32): Offset to embedded CRITICAL_SECTION in stream struct\n- 0x1c (28): Base index for global stream critical sections",
