      "name": "LockStreamByIndex",
      "signature": "void LockStreamByIndex(int nStreamIdx, int nStreamPtr)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires lock on stream based on stream index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nStreamIdx < 0x14, use global indexed critical section (nStreamIdx + 0x1c)\n2. Otherwise, enter critical section embedded in stream structure at offset 0x20\n\nParameters:\n- nStreamIdx (int): Stream index (0-based)\n- nStreamPtr (int): Pointer to stream structure with embedded critical section\n\nReturns:\n- void (lock is held on return)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14 (20): Threshold for global vs embedded critical section\n- 0x1c (28): Offset added to index for global critical section\n- 0x20 (32): Offset to embedded CRITICAL_SECTION in stream structure",
