      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Releases a critical section lock for the given object.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dwObject address is within pooled CS range (0x6ff86370-0x6ff865d0)\n2. If pooled: calculate index from address, call LeaveCriticalSectionByIndex\n3. If external: call LeaveCriticalSection on dwObject+0x20 directly\n\nParameters:\n- dwObject (uint): Address of object containing or identifying a critical section\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6ff86370: Start of pooled critical section array\n- 0x6ff865d0: End of pooled critical section range\n- 0x20: Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION in external objects\n- 0x1c (28): Base index offset for pooled sections",
