      "comment": "Releases the critical section lock for a stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If stream index < 0x14, use global indexed lock (index + 0x1c)\n2. Otherwise, use per-stream lock from stream structure at offset 0x20\n\nParameters:\n- nStreamIdx: Stream slot index\n- pStream: Pointer to stream structure with CRITICAL_SECTION at +0x20\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14 (20): Threshold for global vs per-stream locks\n- 0x1c (28): Offset into global critical section array\n- 0x20 (32): Offset of CRITICAL_SECTION in stream structure",
