      "name": "FlushStreamBuffer",
      "signature": "int FlushStreamBuffer(int * pStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Flushes stream buffer to underlying file handle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Flush write buffer via FlushWriteBuffer\n2. If buffer flush fails, return -1\n3. If stream has commit-on-write flag (0x40), call FlushFileBuffers\n4. Return 0 on success, -1 on failure\n\nParameters:\n- pStream (int*): Pointer to stream structure\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Success\n- -1: Error during buffer flush or file commit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xd: Offset to stream flags byte\n- 0x40: Commit-on-write flag (triggers FlushFileBuffers)\n- pStream[4]: File descriptor/handle at offset 0x10",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
