      "name": "FlushAllStreams",
      "signature": "int FlushAllStreams(int nMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Flushes all open stream buffers based on mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Lock critical section index 2 (stream management)\n2. Iterate through global stream array (g_ppStreamArray)\n3. For each non-null stream with flags & 0x83 set:\n   - Lock the stream by index\n   - If nMode==1: Flush buffer, count successes\n   - If nMode==0 and flag 0x2 set: Flush buffer, track errors\n   - Unlock the stream\n4. Leave critical section\n5. Return success count (mode 1) or error status (mode 0)\n\nParameters:\n- nMode (int): 1 = flush all, return count; 0 = flush modified only\n\nReturns:\n- Mode 1: Number of successfully flushed streams\n- Mode 0: 0 on success, -1 if any flush failed\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x83: Stream flags mask (0x80|0x02|0x01)\n- 0x02: Modified buffer flag\n- 2: Critical section index for stream management",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
