      "name": "ReadFileLocked",
      "signature": "int ReadFileLocked(uint dwFileDesc, byte * pbBuffer, uint dwBytesToRead)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Reads data from file descriptor with thread-safe locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate file descriptor against g_dwMaxFileDesc\n2. Check file table entry flag (bit 0) for valid open file\n3. Acquire file lock via FUN_6ff7bcea\n4. Call ReadFileWithTextMode to perform actual read\n5. Release file lock via FUN_6ff7bd49\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileDesc (uint): File descriptor index\n- pbBuffer (byte*): Destination buffer for read data\n- dwBytesToRead (uint): Number of bytes to read\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes read on success\n- -1 on error (sets errno=9 EBADF, OsError=0)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): File table entry stride\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for entry index within block\n- 9: EBADF (Bad file descriptor)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
