      "name": "WriteFileLocked",
      "signature": "int WriteFileLocked(uint dwFileDesc, char * pbBuffer, uint dwCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Writes data to a file descriptor with locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate dwFileDesc < g_dwMaxFileDesc\n2. Check file entry exists in g_apFileTable (flags & 1)\n3. Acquire file lock via FUN_6ff7bcea\n4. Perform write via FUN_6ff780ea\n5. Release lock via FUN_6ff7bd49\n6. On invalid handle: set errno=9 (EBADF), return -1\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileDesc (uint): File descriptor index\n- pbBuffer (char*): Source buffer to write from\n- dwCount (uint): Number of bytes to write\n\nReturns:\n- Bytes written on success\n- -1 on invalid file descriptor\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): File table entry stride\n- 0x1f: Mask for entry index within bucket\n- 0x9: EBADF errno value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
