      "name": "GetNextStreamByte",
      "signature": "uint GetNextStreamByte(uint * pStream)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Reads next byte from stream buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decrement buffer count at pStream[1]\n2. If count >= 0, read byte from current position\n3. Advance buffer pointer at pStream[0]\n4. If buffer exhausted, call FillStreamBuffer\n\nParameters:\n- pStream (uint*): FILE stream structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- Byte value (0-255) on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF on EOF/error (via FillStreamBuffer)",
