      "comment": "Skips whitespace characters in input stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Increment character count\n2. Get next byte from stream\n3. Test if byte is whitespace (type mask 8)\n4. Loop while whitespace found\n5. Return first non-whitespace byte\n\nParameters:\n- pnCharCount (int*): Pointer to character count to update\n- pStream (uint*): Stream buffer structure\n\nReturns:\n- First non-whitespace byte from stream, or EOF marker",
