      "name": "NotifyRuntimeExit",
      "signature": "void NotifyRuntimeExit(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Invokes pre-exit notification before runtime error display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if app is console (g_dwAppType==1) or GUI with msgbox enabled\n2. Call runtime error display with pre-message code (0xfc)\n3. Call custom exit handler if registered\n4. Call runtime error display with post-message code (0xff)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xfc (252): Pre-error message notification code\n- 0xff (255): Post-error message notification code\n- 1: Console application type\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __amsg_exit: Caller that handles runtime errors\n- FUN_6ff792cc: Runtime error message display",
