      "name": "ShiftRightMultiWord",
      "signature": "void ShiftRightMultiWord(uint * pdwWords, uint dwShiftBits)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Shifts a 3-dword (96-bit) value right by N bits.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute word offset (dwShiftBits / 32) and bit offset (dwShiftBits % 32)\n2. First loop: Shift bits within each dword, carrying overflow to next\n3. Second loop: Move dwords by word offset, zeroing vacated positions\n\nParameters:\n- pdwWords (uint*): Array of 3 dwords to shift in place\n- dwShiftBits (uint): Number of bits to shift right\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies array in place)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x20 (32): Bits per dword\n- 3: Number of dwords in array",
