      "name": "DivideExtendedPrecisionWrapper",
      "signature": "uint DivideExtendedPrecisionWrapper(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Wrapper for extended precision FPU division via ST0/ST1.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x2c bytes on stack for 80-bit operands\n2. FSTP ST(1) divisor to stack at [ESP+0xc]\n3. FSTP ST(0) dividend to stack at [ESP]\n4. Call DivideExtendedPrecision with stack operands\n5. Clean stack and return EAX (division status)\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: ST(0) contains dividend (80-bit extended)\n- IMPLICIT: ST(1) contains divisor (80-bit extended)\n\nReturns:\n- uint in EAX: Division result status from DivideExtendedPrecision\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DivideExtendedPrecision: Actual division implementation\n- ComputePowerExponentiation: Caller for 1/x reciprocal",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
