      "name": "EnsureTimezoneInitialized",
      "signature": "void EnsureTimezoneInitialized(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Ensures timezone data is initialized exactly once using double-check locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Quick check if already initialized (g_fTimezoneInitialized != 0)\n2. If not, acquire critical section 0xb\n3. Re-check inside lock (double-check pattern)\n4. If still uninitialized, call FUN_6ff7b31e to parse TZ env or GetTimeZoneInformation\n5. Increment g_fTimezoneInitialized to mark complete\n6. Release critical section\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6ff7b31e: Actual timezone parsing/initialization\n- ConvertDateTimeToTimestamp: Caller that needs timezone data",
