      "name": "ComputeDstTransitionDate",
      "signature": "void ComputeDstTransitionDate(int nIsDstStart, int nIsWeekMode, uint dwYear, int nMonth, int nWeek, int nDayOfWeek, int nDayOfMonth, int nHour, int nMinute, int nSecond, int nMillisec)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Computes day-of-year and time-of-day for DST transition dates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If week-based mode (nIsWeekMode=1):\n   a. Get cumulative days for month from leap/non-leap array\n   b. Calculate day-of-week for first day of month using Zeller-like formula\n   c. Compute target day using week number and day-of-week offset\n   d. If week 5 (last), clamp to month boundary\n2. If day-based mode: simply add day-of-month to cumulative days\n3. Convert time components to milliseconds since midnight\n4. Store results in DST start or end globals based on nIsDstStart\n\nParameters:\n- nIsDstStart: 1=DST start transition, 0=DST end transition\n- nIsWeekMode: 1=week/day-of-week based, 0=day-of-month based\n- dwYear: Year for calculation (also used for leap year check via &3)\n- nMonth: 0-based month index into cumulative days array\n- nWeek: Week number (1-5, where 5=last week of month)\n- nDayOfWeek: Day of week (0=Sunday, 6=Saturday)\n- nDayOfMonth: Day of month (for non-week mode)\n- nHour, nMinute, nSecond, nMillisec: Time components\n\nReturns:\n- void (results stored in g_dwDstStartYear/g_nDstStartDayOfYear/g_nDstStartTimeMs or g_dwDstEndYear/g_nDstEndDayOfYear globals)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x16d (365): Days per year\n- 0x63db (25563): Day offset for epoch calculation\n- 0x3c (60): Minutes/seconds conversion\n- 0x3e8 (1000): Milliseconds conversion\n- 86400000 (0x5265c00): Milliseconds per day",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:6d50544faaf636cd3d820cef87818a92",
