      "name": "GetFileOsHandle",
      "signature": "dword GetFileOsHandle(dword nFileDesc)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Retrieves OS file handle from CRT file descriptor table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nFileDesc < g_dwMaxFileDesc\n2. Compute table index: bucket = nFileDesc >> 5, slot = nFileDesc & 0x1F\n3. Check entry flags at offset 0x4 for valid bit (& 1)\n4. Return OS handle from entry offset 0x0\n5. On error: set errno=9 (EBADF), osError=0, return -1\n\nParameters:\n- nFileDesc (dword): CRT file descriptor index\n\nReturns:\n- OS file handle on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF (-1) on invalid descriptor\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): File entry structure stride\n- 0x1F (31): Slot mask (32 entries per bucket)\n- 9: EBADF (Bad file descriptor)",
