      "comment": "Releases the critical section lock for a file descriptor entry.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract table index (handle >> 5) and slot index (handle & 0x1f)\n2. Calculate critical section address from file table entry\n3. Call LeaveCriticalSection to release the lock\n\nParameters:\n- dwFileHandle (uint): File descriptor handle encoding table/slot indices\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1f (31): Slot index mask (5 bits, 32 slots per table)\n- 0x5: Bit shift for table index extraction\n- 0x24 (36): File descriptor entry stride in bytes\n- 0xc (12): Offset to CRITICAL_SECTION within entry",
