      "name": "ResolveSpecialCodePage",
      "signature": "uint ResolveSpecialCodePage(int nCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Resolves special code page constants to actual code page values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nCodePage == -2 (CP_OEMCP), return GetOEMCP() result\n2. If nCodePage == -3 (CP_ACP), return GetACP() result\n3. If nCodePage == -4 (CP_THREAD_ACP/default), return g_nDefaultCodePage\n4. Otherwise return nCodePage unchanged\n\nParameters:\n- nCodePage (int): Code page ID or special constant (-2, -3, -4)\n\nReturns:\n- Resolved code page number (uint)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- -2: CP_OEMCP - system OEM code page\n- -3: CP_ACP - system ANSI code page\n- -4: Thread/default code page from g_nDefaultCodePage\n\nSide Effects:\n- Sets g_fCodePageIsSpecial to 1 if special constant was resolved, 0 otherwise",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8f2a733057dd5a290f0e17d077c53986",
