      "name": "AddWithCarry",
      "signature": "uint AddWithCarry(uint dwAddend1, uint dwAddend2, uint * pdwSum)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Adds two unsigned 32-bit integers and detects overflow.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute sum = dwAddend1 + dwAddend2\n2. Check for unsigned overflow (sum < either addend)\n3. Store sum in output pointer\n4. Return carry flag (1 if overflow, 0 otherwise)\n\nParameters:\n- dwAddend1 (uint): First addend\n- dwAddend2 (uint): Second addend\n- pdwSum (uint*): Output pointer for sum result\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if overflow (carry) occurred, 0 otherwise\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ___add_12: Big-integer addition using this for limb operations\n- PropagateCarryFromBitPos: Carry propagation in multi-precision arithmetic",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
