      "name": "ShiftLeft96Bit",
      "signature": "void ShiftLeft96Bit(uint * pdwData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Performs a 1-bit left shift on a 96-bit integer stored as 3 consecutive DWORDs.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read pdwData[0] and pdwData[1]\n2. Shift pdwData[0] left by 1 (multiply by 2)\n3. Shift pdwData[1] left by 1, OR in carry bit from pdwData[0]\n4. Shift pdwData[2] left by 1, OR in carry bit from pdwData[1]\n\nParameters:\n- pdwData (uint*): Pointer to 3-element array representing 96-bit value (LSB first)\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies pdwData in place)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1f (31): Bit position to extract carry (MSB of each DWORD)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:58ce78ec7b76961d09886d9a93b93cae",
