      "name": "CompareStringsLocaleAware",
      "signature": "int CompareStringsLocaleAware(byte * pbStr1, char * szStr2, uint dwMaxCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Case-insensitive string comparison with locale awareness.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nMaxCount is 0, return immediately (no comparison)\n2. If no locale active (g_dwLocaleId == 0):\n   - Simple ASCII comparison, convert A-Z to a-z inline\n   - Compare characters byte-by-byte\n3. If locale active:\n   - Acquire locale lock (critical section 0x13 if locked)\n   - Use ToLowerCaseLocaleAware() for proper locale conversion\n   - Release lock after comparison\n\nParameters:\n- pbStr1 (byte*): First string to compare\n- szStr2 (char*): Second string to compare\n- nMaxCount (uint): Maximum characters to compare\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Strings are equal (up to nMaxCount chars)\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF): pbStr1 < szStr2\n- 1: pbStr1 > szStr2\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x40 (64): Character before 'A' in ASCII\n- 0x5B (91): Character after 'Z' in ASCII\n- 0x20 (32): Offset to convert uppercase to lowercase\n- 0x13 (19): Critical section index for locale operations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
