      "name": "GetEnvironmentValue",
      "signature": "char * GetEnvironmentValue(char * szVarName)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Searches environment array for variable by name, returns pointer to value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify environment initialized (g_fEnvironInitialized != 0)\n2. Get environment array pointer (g_ppszEnviron), lazy-init if needed\n3. Compute input name length with _strlen\n4. Iterate each NAME=VALUE string in array\n5. Compare lengths (value length must exceed name length)\n6. Check for '=' at expected position\n7. Case-insensitive compare name portion via __mbsnbicoll\n8. Return pointer to value (past '=') on match\n\nParameters:\n- szVarName (char*): Environment variable name to find\n\nReturns:\n- char*: Pointer to value portion if found, NULL otherwise",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
