      "comment": "Calculates string length bounded by maximum count (strnlen equivalent).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loop through string bytes until null terminator or dwMaxLen reached\n2. If null found within bounds, return actual string length\n3. If limit reached without null, return dwMaxLen\n\nParameters:\n- szString (char*): Input string to measure\n- dwMaxLen (uint): Maximum bytes to scan\n\nReturns:\n- Actual string length if null found within bounds\n- dwMaxLen if no null terminator found within limit",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
