      "name": "FindEnvironmentEntryIndex",
      "signature": "int FindEnvironmentEntryIndex(uchar * pszName, size_t nNameLen)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Searches the environment array for an entry matching the given name.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through g_ppszEnviron array from start\n2. Compare name prefix using case-insensitive multibyte comparison\n3. If match found and followed by '=' or '\\0', return positive index\n4. If end of array (NULL), return negative count\n\nParameters:\n- pszName (uchar*): Environment variable name to search for\n- nNameLen (size_t): Length of name in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- Non-negative index if entry found (pointer math >> 2)\n- Negative count if not found (negated index at end)",
