      "name": "DuplicateString",
      "signature": "char * DuplicateString(char * szSrc)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Duplicates a null-terminated string by allocating new memory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return NULL if input string is NULL\n2. Get string length via strlen\n3. Allocate length+1 bytes via malloc\n4. Copy string to new buffer via strcpy\n5. Return pointer to duplicated string, or NULL on allocation failure\n\nParameters:\n- szSrc (char*): Source string to duplicate\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to newly allocated duplicate string, or NULL on failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CopyStringArray: Caller that duplicates array elements",
