      "name": "ResizeVectorStorage",
      "signature": "void ResizeVectorStorage(uint newCapacity)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Dynamically resizes a vector's storage buffer to accommodate a new capacity.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Load current buffer pointer from vector structure at ESI+8 into EBX\\n2. Store new capacity value into vector capacity field at ESI+0\\n3. Attempt realloc on old buffer to (newCapacity * 4) bytes via AllocateOrReallocateMemory\\n4. Update vector buffer pointer at ESI+8 with realloc result\\n5. If realloc fails (EAX == 0):\\n   - Call AllocateMemoryFromArena to allocate new buffer of (newCapacity * 4) bytes\\n   - Update vector buffer pointer at ESI+8 with new allocation\\n   - If old buffer exists (EBX != 0):\\n     a. Load current size from vector at ESI+4\\n     b. Determine copy limit as min(newCapacity, current size)\\n     c. For i = 0 to copyLimit-1: copy old[i] to new[i] (4-byte elements)\\n     d. Call DeallocateMemoryBlock to free old buffer\\n6. Return to caller via RET 0x4\\n\\nParameters:\\n  newCapacity: New capacity in elements (passed via EBP stack parameter)\\n  ESI (implicit): Pointer to vector structure with layout:\\n    [ESI+0]: capacity (dword) - current max elements\\n    [ESI+4]: size (dword) - current element count\\n    [ESI+8]: data (dword *) - pointer to element buffer\\n\\nReturns:\\n  void (vector modified in-place via ESI register parameter)\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n  - Realloc failure: Falls back to malloc+copy+free pattern to preserve old data\\n  - Null old buffer: Skips copy step if old buffer is NULL\\n  - Null new buffer: Skips copy step if new allocation fails\\n  - Data truncation: If newCapacity < current size, only min(newCapacity, size) elements copied\\n  - Memory alignment: All allocations multiplied by 4 bytes per element\\n\\nCalling Convention:\\n  __stdcall with implicit vector pointer in ESI register (common pattern for vector operations)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:1568b71261da2189803ba4295bb86adf",
