      "name": "ValidateStackFrameWithRetry",
      "signature": "int ValidateStackFrameWithRetry(HANDLE hModuleHandle, uint dwBaseOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Validates a stack frame by retrying with progressively adjusted offset parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load function pointer from global g_pfnSymGetLineFromAddr\n2. Check if function pointer is valid (non-null); return 0 if null\n3. Call validation function with original module handle and base offset\n4. If validation succeeds (result != 0), skip retry loop and return 1\n5. If validation fails, enter retry loop with retry counter starting at 0\n6. Increment retry counter and check if exceeded maximum (0x64 = 100 retries)\n7. Return 0 if max retries exceeded without successful validation\n8. Call validation function again with decremented offset (baseOffset - retryCount)\n9. Loop steps 6-8 until either validation succeeds or max retries reached\n10. If any retries occurred before success, store retry count at output buffer\n11. Return 1 to indicate successful validation (with or without retries)\n\nParameters:\n  hModuleHandle - Handle to module being validated (used as first param to validation function)\n  dwBaseOffset - Base stack frame offset; decremented by retry count on each attempt\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Validation successful (either on first try or after retries)\n  0 - Validation failed after maximum retry attempts (100) or no function pointer available\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  If g_pfnSymGetLineFromAddr is null, returns immediately with 0\n  Retry counter increments from 0 to 100; when counter reaches 100, returns failure\n  Output buffer receives retry count only if validation initially failed but succeeded after retries\n  If validation succeeds on first attempt, skips retry loop entirely\n  Maximum 100 retry attempts prevents infinite loops on persistently invalid frames\n  Stack frame offset adjusted linearly: each retry subtracts one unit from base offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8618433317c03b31dcf5b24b07e195a6",
