      "name": "InitializeGameContext",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameContext(void * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initializes game context structure by validating initialization flag, setting sentinel values, and clearing array data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load initialization flag from context offset +0x108\n2. If flag equals zero, call error logging and exit process (critical failure)\n3. Initialize loop counter elementIndex to 0\n4. Set context field at offset +0x110 to 0xffffffff (sentinel/invalid marker)\n5. Set context field at offset +0x114 to 0 (clear field 5)\n6. Set context field at offset +0x10c to 0 (clear field 3)\n7. Set context field at offset +0x118 to 0x8000 (status flag indicating initialized state)\n8. Load element count from context offset +0x100\n9. If count <= 0, skip array clearing loop\n10. Loop: For each element index from 0 to count-1:\n    a. Load stride multiplier from context offset +0x104\n    b. Load array base pointer from context offset +0x11c\n    c. Calculate element address as (stride * index) + array_base\n    d. Write 2-byte zero value to element address\n    e. Increment index and check if index < count\n11. Restore saved registers and return\n\nParameters:\n  pContext (ECX register): Pointer to game context structure\n    Offset +0x100: element_count - Number of array elements to clear (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x104: array_stride - Byte stride between array elements (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x108: init_flag - Validation flag; non-zero=valid, zero=fatal error (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x10c: field_3 - Field to clear to zero (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x110: sentinel_marker - Set to 0xffffffff (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x114: field_5 - Field to clear to zero (DWORD)\n    Offset +0x118: status_flags - Set to 0x8000 (WORD)\n    Offset +0x11c: array_base - Base address of array to clear (DWORD pointer)\n\nReturns:\n  void: No return value on success. Process terminates on validation failure via _exit(-1).\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If init_flag at offset +0x108 is zero, function logs error via LogErrorAndShutdown and calls WSACleanup before terminating with exit code -1 (0xffffffff)\n  - Array clearing loop only executes if element_count > 0; if count <= 0, array clearing is skipped\n  - Sentinel value 0xffffffff at offset +0x110 likely marks context as uninitialized or error state\n  - Status flag 0x8000 indicates successful context initialization\n  - Error path calls GetReturnAddress, WSACleanup, LogErrorAndShutdown, and ShutdownResourcesAndExit before exit\n  - Error message: szUnrecoverableErrorMessage (&quot;Unrecoverable internal error %08x&quot;)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
