      "name": "CopyGameSessionConfigToGlobals",
      "signature": "void CopyGameSessionConfigToGlobals(GameSessionConfig * pConfig)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Copies game session configuration from a config structure to global variables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load session ID from config at offset 0x0 and store to g_dwGameSessionId\n2. Load game speed from config at offset 0x4 and store to g_dwGameSpeed\n3. Load monster mode from config at offset 0xc and store to g_dwMonsterMode\n4. Calculate difficulty by decrementing session ID and store to g_dwGameDifficulty\n5. Load speed/flags from config at offset 0x8 and store to g_dwMonsterMode\n6. Store monster mode copy to alternate location g_dwGameMonsterMode\n\nParameters:\n  pConfig [GameSessionConfig *] - Pointer to game session configuration structure\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Difficulty is calculated as (SessionID - 1)\n  - Monster mode is stored in two global locations for redundancy or different purposes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
