      "name": "CountLinkedListNodes",
      "signature": "int CountLinkedListNodes(void * pGameState, int nSlotIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Counts the number of nodes in a linked list for a specified slot index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load maximum valid slot index from pGameState + 0x87c\n2. Validate that nSlotIndex < maximum value; return -1 if invalid\n3. Calculate critical section address at pGameState + 0x854\n4. Call ValidateDataStructureIntegrity with critical section address and marker 0x592\n5. Enter critical section via EnterCriticalSection to ensure thread-safe access\n6. Load array of linked list head pointers from pGameState + 0x870\n7. Index into array: [pGameState + 0x870 + nSlotIndex * 4] to get first node\n8. Iterate through linked list by following next pointer at offset +0x5bc on each node\n9. Increment counter (nodeCount) for each node visited\n10. Terminate loop when next pointer is NULL (end of list)\n11. Exit critical section via LeaveCriticalSection\n12. Return total node count\n\nParameters:\n  pGameState (void *): Pointer to game state structure containing:\n    - [+0x870]: Array of linked list head node pointers (indexed by slot)\n    - [+0x87c]: Maximum valid slot index (validates range)\n    - [+0x854]: Critical section for thread-safe list access\n  nSlotIndex (int): Slot index into the linked list array; must be < max value at +0x87c\n\nReturns:\n  int: Count of nodes in the linked list; or -1 if nSlotIndex is out of bounds\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 if first node pointer is NULL (empty linked list)\n  - Returns -1 if nSlotIndex >= value at pGameState + 0x87c (bounds check failure)\n  - Uses __stdcall calling convention (callee cleans 8 bytes = 2 parameters)\n  - Critical section protects traversal from concurrent modification\n  - Linked list structure: each node contains pointer to next node at offset +0x5bc\n\nStructure Layout:\n  GameState Structure (referenced in this function):\n  Offset  Size  Field Name            Type        Description\n  ------  ----  --------------------  ----------  ------------------------------------------\n  0x854   4     criticalSection       HANDLE      Critical section handle for synchronization\n  0x870   4     linkedListHeads       pointer[]   Array of linked list head node pointers\n  0x87c   4     maxSlotIndex          uint        Maximum valid slot index (bounds limit)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
