      "name": "InitializeGameData",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize PKware decompressor data structures and state variables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear the source Huffman table at g_dwHuffmanSourceTable (0x6ff80ed0)\n2. Set up bulk memory copy: ECX=0x1fe (510 dwords), ESI=source, EDI=destination\n3. Execute REP MOVSD to copy 510 DWORDs (2040 bytes) from source to g_dwHuffmanDestTable\n4. Clear 6 decompressor state variables (g_dwDecompressorState0 through State5) to 0\n5. Load ECX with pointer to g_pHuffmanDecoderTable (0x6ff7f210)\n6. Tail-call InitializePKWareDecodeTables to complete initialization\n\nParameters:\nNone - Entry point initialization with no parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Does not return; transfers control to InitializePKWareDecodeTables via tail call\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Entry point function called once at startup\n- Uses REP MOVSD instruction for high-performance bulk memory copy\n- Total copy size: 0x1fe DWORDs = 510 dwords = 2040 bytes (0x7F8 bytes)\n- State variables cleared are consecutive DWORDs at offsets +0, +4, +8, +12, +16, +20\n- Tail call optimization: transfers control directly without return\n\nStructure Layout:\nHuffman Table Region (0x6ff80ed0 - 0x6ff80ed8):\nOffset | Size | Field Name               | Type    | Description\n-----  | ---- | ----------------------   | ------- | ------------------------------------------------\n0      | 4    | g_dwHuffmanSourceTable   | DWORD   | Source table for Huffman data (cleared at init)\n8      | 4    | g_dwHuffmanDestTable     | DWORD   | Destination for 510-dword Huffman copy\nTotal: 8 bytes\n\nDecompressor State Region (0x6ff9af48 - 0x6ff9af5c):\nOffset | Size | Field Name               | Type    | Description\n-----  | ---- | ----------------------   | ------- | ------------------------------------------------\n0      | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState0   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 0\n4      | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState1   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 1\n8      | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState2   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 2\n12     | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState3   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 3\n16     | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState4   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 4\n20     | 4    | g_dwDecompressorState5   | DWORD   | Decompressor state flag 5\nTotal: 24 bytes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:7f5a23458c57dc4e4a80ec5717a46eaa",
