      "name": "InitializePerformanceCounters",
      "signature": "void InitializePerformanceCounters(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize high-resolution performance counter system.\n\nAlgorithm:\nStep 1: Allocate 8-byte stack buffer for LARGE_INTEGER structure\nStep 2: Call QueryPerformanceFrequency to obtain system counter frequency\nStep 3: Calculate millisecond conversion factor (frequency / 1,000)\nStep 4: Store millisecond factor at g_dwPerformanceTicksPerMillisecond\nStep 5: Calculate microsecond conversion factor (frequency / 1,000,000)\nStep 6: Store microsecond factor at g_dwPerformanceTicksPerMicrosecond\nStep 7: Zero entire accumulator array (24,576 DWORD elements) using REP STOSD\nStep 8: Call GetTickCount to capture baseline system tick count\nStep 9: Store baseline at g_dwPerformanceCounterBaseline for relative timing\nStep 10: Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nFunction takes no parameters - initializes global state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, initializes global variables",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:d46e94d66ac0d0059fee34d04174c8d7",
