      "name": "ValidateContextSignatureAndWaitThread",
      "signature": "void ValidateContextSignatureAndWaitThread(void * pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Summary:\nValidates context structure signature and waits for thread completion before\ninitiating graceful shutdown sequence. All code paths terminate the process.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify pContext is not NULL; if NULL, log error 0x237 and exit\n2. Load signature field at offset +0x48 and mask with 0xFFFFFFF0\n3. Compare masked signature against magic sentinel 0x41737960\n4. If signature invalid, log error 0x238 and exit\n5. Call ValidateContextAndWaitHandle(pContext) for extended validation\n6. If validation returns non-zero (early exit condition), return immediately\n7. Load event handle at offset +0x3c and signal it via SetEventWrapper\n8. Load thread handle pointer at offset +0x38, dereference to get HANDLE\n9. Call WaitForSingleObject with infinite timeout (-1) to wait for thread\n10. If wait returns non-zero (failure), log error 0x24d and exit\n11. Move pContext to EAX as implicit return value\n12. Jump to CleanupContextResourceAndReset for final cleanup\n\nParameters:\npContext (void*): Pointer to context structure with offsets:\n  +0x38: HANDLE** - Pointer to thread handle pointer\n  +0x3c: DWORD - Thread event handle for signaling\n  +0x48: DWORD - Magic signature field (masked & 0xFFFFFFF0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (function never returns; all paths lead to _exit or cleanup)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL pContext triggers immediate error 0x237 shutdown\n- Invalid signature (not 0x41737960) triggers error 0x238 shutdown  \n- ValidationResult non-zero causes early return without wait\n- WaitForSingleObject failure (non-zero) triggers error 0x24d shutdown\n- All error paths call CleanupAndAbort or ShutdownResourcesAndExit\n- Magic signature 0x41737960 appears to be context validation sentinel\n- Function uses non-volatile register ESI in __fastcall convention",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
