      "name": "ValidateEntityState",
      "signature": "uint ValidateEntityState(void * pEntity)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates entity/game object integrity by verifying magic signature and initialization state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test entity pointer against NULL - if null, log critical error and exit\n2. Load 32-bit signature field from entity base + 0x48\n3. Mask signature with 0xfffffff0 to remove version/flag bits\n4. Compare masked signature against magic constant 0x41737960\n5. If mismatch, log validation error and exit immediately\n6. Check bit 0 of signature (initialization flag) - if clear, initialize via ValidateAndProcessContext\n7. After initialization, verify bit 0 is now set - if still clear, log error and exit\n8. Return 32-bit entity handle from offset 0x3c\n\nParameters:\n  pEntity (void *): Pointer to entity structure with signature/flags at offset 0x48 and handle at offset 0x3c\n\nReturns:\n  uint: Entity handle value from offset 0x3c\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Magic signature: 0x41737960 masked against 0xfffffff0 (ASCII \"As y\" pattern)\n  - Initialization flag: bit 0 of signature field (0x41737961 when initialized)\n  - Null pointer or invalid signature triggers critical error logging and process termination\n  - Failed initialization causes process exit",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
