      "signature": "void InitializeCharacterFilterBuffer(int * pFilterBuffer, int nCharacterCount, int nBitWidth)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes a character filter lookup table for character encoding/decoding operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pFilterBuffer parameter is not NULL; if NULL, trigger fatal error shutdown\n2. Initialize pFilterBuffer[0] with nCharacterCount value (character count)\n3. Calculate shifted bit width: nBitWidth << 3 (left shift by 3, multiply by 8)\n4. Initialize pFilterBuffer[1] with shifted bit width value\n5. Zero initialize remaining fields: pFilterBuffer[2], pFilterBuffer[3], pFilterBuffer[4]\n6. Return void after successful initialization\n\nParameters:\npFilterBuffer [int*]: Pointer to 5-dword filter buffer structure; must not be NULL\nnCharacterCount [int]: Number of characters to store in filterBuffer[0]\nnBitWidth [int]: Bit width value to be shifted left by 3 and stored in filterBuffer[1]\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Initializes buffer in-place; terminates with fatal error if pFilterBuffer is NULL\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL buffer validation: Error code 0x13c (312 decimal) triggers WSACleanup, LogErrorAndInitiateShutdown, and exit(-1)\n- Filter buffer structure: Always exactly 5 dwords (20 bytes total)\n- Bit width shift: nBitWidth is left-shifted by 3 bits (equivalent to multiply by 8)\n- Zero initialization: Last three dwords are explicitly zeroed\n- Usage context: Called during character processing initialization phase as prerequisite to character iteration\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | dwCharCount | dword | Character count parameter\n0x4    | 4    | dwShiftedSize | dword | Bit width shifted left by 3\n0x8    | 4    | dwReserved1 | dword | Reserved, initialized to zero\n0xc    | 4    | dwReserved2 | dword | Reserved, initialized to zero\n0x10   | 4    | dwReserved3 | dword | Reserved, initialized to zero\nTotal: 20 bytes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:4e2690e85ab304c00638f2a19c048f8a",
