      "name": "SetSocketNonBlocking",
      "signature": "void SetSocketNonBlocking(void * pSocketContainer)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Sets a socket to non-blocking mode using FIONBIO ioctl.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load SOCKET from pSocketContainer at offset +8\n2. Prepare local variable nonBlockingMode and set to 1\n3. Call ioctlsocket() with socket, FIONBIO (0x8004667e), and nonBlockingMode address\n4. Return void\n\nParameters:\npSocketContainer: Pointer to structure containing SOCKET at offset +8. Type: void *\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x8004667e is the FIONBIO ioctl command (enable non-blocking mode)\n- The value 1 enables non-blocking mode; 0 would disable it\n- ioctlsocket() is a Windows socket API function for socket control operations",
